      "question": "In the return-correlation network from June through August 2026, which issuers are the most central, and which pairs moved together most closely?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-01T20:35:17.132423Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-01T20:36:01.613564Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Most central issuers (PageRank centrality, June 1 – Aug 31 2026)**\n\n| Rank | Issuer (asset ID) | Centrality |\n|------|-------------------|------------|\n| 1 | PREX | 0.00949 |\n| 2 | SHIE | 0.00692 |\n| 3 | STAS | 0.00687 |\n| 4 | RIOM | 0.00672 |\n| 5 | VIAL | 0.00589 |\n| 6 | GRUA | 0.00577 |\n| 7 | CLEX | 0.00572 |\n| 8 | TISL | 0.00551 |\n| 9 | GRES | 0.00551 |\n| 10 | TOUA | 0.00548 |\n\n**Pairs that moved together most closely (highest absolute daily‑return correlation)**\n\n| Rank | Issuer A | Issuer B | Correlation |\n|------|----------|----------|-------------|\n| 1 | CLCL | PIAX | 0.8983 |\n| 2 | DROO | PRIX | 0.8826 |\n| 3 | CHOB | CLCL | 0.8732 |\n| 4 | CAED | RIOM | 0.8631 |\n| 5 | BREN | RIOM | 0.8576 |\n| 6 | DROO | RIAH | 0.8559 |\n| 7 | LIOT | RIOM | 0.8551 |\n| 8 | CORK | DROO | 0.8432 |\n| 9 | CLAA | RIOM | 0.8367 |\n| 10 | THII | THST | 0.8332 |\n\n*Source: return‑correlation network analysis for the June‑through‑August 2026 window (2000 assets, 30 128 edges) – centrality and strongest edges returned by the market‑analytics tool* `[1]`.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Market analytics result — analyze market relationships — evidence `hermes-receipt:b5c9433d0fc6063cac4417ae4e62492484ad9afb2f82800d390f5eb2578edb07`",
